			(property "Description" "Same Sky (CUI) PJ-002AH: 2.0mm center-pin / 5.5mm OD DC barrel jack, right-angle THT, 5A. Pin1=TIP(center pin), Pin2=SLEEVE(barrel/GND), Pin3=normally-closed detect SWITCH (shorts to SLEEVE when no plug inserted; left NC in this design -- no insertion-detect logic in subsystem D). EXT rear-bracket power-in (BOM-D group 5). Center-positive by convention; silkscreen/label at the bracket per BOM-D open item 2."
